  "plain": "In the 1970s, Robert Monroe, a man who ran his own program exploring consciousness, invited the young Jeffrey Mishlove to join it, but Mishlove turned it down because he was already studying at Berkeley. Mishlove, who went on to earn a doctorate in the study of the mind and psychic matters, tells this first-hand."
